TLS material for the control-plane proxy is generated at bootstrap time
into this directory and is git-ignored:

  forge-ai.crt   self-signed certificate (or your CA-issued certificate)
  forge-ai.key   private key, mode 0600

Generate or regenerate with:

  ./bootstrap/create-secrets.sh --tls-only

Replacing the self-signed pair with a CA-issued one is a straight file
swap; nothing else in the stack needs to change. See docs/SECURITY.md.
